==Description==
The '''Constelation Nametag''' is a nametag added as part of the [[Operation I.C.E Event]]. It was originally meant to be obtainable from it, though that never happened, leaving it unused in-game.

The '''Constelation Nametag''' has a purple, yellow to purple gradient text with a translucent purple outline. Large purple smoke can be seen behind the text. There is a star constellation on it, which contains six stars connected by multiple yellow lines.

==Trivia==
*The name of the nametag is actually misspelled in-game, as it should be called ''Constellation Nametag'' and not ''Constelation Nametag''.
*The '''Constelation Nametag''' would eventually be repurposed as the [[Guiding Star Nametag]], which is nearly identical.

